{
  "id": "JAS.2",
  "number": "2",
  "bookId": "JAS",
  "reference": "Yakobo 2",
  "verseCount": 26,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JAS 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bene Data, abizera Umwami wacu w’ubwiza Yesu Kristo, ntibarobanura ku butoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nk’akarorero hinjiye umuntu mw’ikoraniro ryanyu yambaye impeta y’inzahabu n’impuzu nziza, hakinjira n’uwundi yambaye impuzu zishize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo mwitayeho cane wa wundi yambaye neza mukamubwira muti: “Ehe ng’iki ikibanza ciza canyu,” ariko mukabwira wa mukene muti: “Wewe hagarara harya” canke muti: “Icara hasi i ruhande y’ibirenge vyanje,” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbega ntimuba mwiciyemwo ibice hagati yanyu kandi mugaca imanza mufise intumbero mbi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umviriza bene Data nkunda. Mbega Imana ntiyatoranije abitwa abakene muvy’iyi si ngo babe abatunzi mu vyo kwizera no kuzoragwa Ubwami yasezeraniye abayikunda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko mwebwe mutetereza umukene! Mbega si abatunzi babacuranguza bongera babashengeza mu bucamanza? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbega si bo bacokora rya zina ryiza mwitirirwa?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mugira neza, nimwaba vy’ukuri mukizigamye ca cagezwe kiri mu Vyanditswe kivuga ngo: “Ukunde mugenzawe nk’uko wikunda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Abalewi 19:18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko, nimwaba mukirobanura abantu ku butoni, muzoba mucumuye kandi mutsinzwe n’urubanza rw’uko murenga ku vyagezwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko uwitondera ivyagezwe vyose ariko agatsitara kuri kimwe acirirwa urubanza nk’uwabicumuyeko vyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko Imana yavuze ngo: “Ntugasambane”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kuvayo 20:14; Gusubiramwo 5:18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ni na yo yavuze ngo: “Ntukice.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kuvayo 20:13; Gusubiramwo 5:17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Rero naho utosambana ariko ukica, uzoba warenze ku vyagezwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mvugo no mu ngiro, mukore nk’abazocirwa urubanza n’ivyagezwe bitanga umwidegemvyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuko mu guca imanza, Imana atazogirira imbabazi abanse kuzigirira abandi. Ariko abagira imbabazi bazozigirirwa, kuko imbabazi zitsinda urubanza!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbega vyomara iki ga bene Data, nimba umuntu avuga ko afise ukwizera ariko ntakwerekanishe ibikorwa? Mbega ukwizera ben’ukwo kwoshobora kumukiza? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dufate ko hari mwene Data atagira ico yambara canke ico afungura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamwe umwe muri mwebwe yomubwira ati: “Niwigire amahoro, wambare neza kandi ufungure,” ariko ntagire ico akora, yoba amufashije iki? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ko bimeze, n’ukwizera kwonyene kudaherekejwe n’ibikorwa, kuba gupfuye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko hariho uwoshobora kuvuga ati: “Bamwe bafise ukwizera, abandi na bo bafise ibikorwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko, jewe nanje nomubaza nti: “Ni gute ushobora kunyereka ukwizera kwawe kandi ata bikorwa? Jewe nokwereka ukwizera kwanje mu kukwereka ibikorwa vyiza.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uvuga ko ufise ukwizera kuko wizera ko hari Imana imwe. Ivyo ni vyiza! Ariko n’abadayimoni ivyo baravyizera, mbere bakanajugumira kubera gutinya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbega imburabwenge! Ukeneye ikikwemeza ko ukwizera kutagira ibikorwa ata co kumaze? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbega sogokuruza wacu Aburahamu ntiyiswe umugororotsi kubera ivyo yakoze, mu kwemera gutanga Isaka nk’ikimazi ku gicaniro? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Urabona rero ko ukwizera kwiwe n’ibikorwa vyiwe vyose vyakoreye hamwe, ukwizera kwiwe kukuzuzwa n’ibikorwa yakoze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma Ivyanditswe bivuga ngo: “Aburahamu yizeye Imana bituma imwemera nk’umugororotsi,”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:23",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Itanguriro 15:6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " birashitswa mbere aca yitwa umukunzi w’Imana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
